      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Krea 2 - DaSiWa DarkDesire V3 Turbo UC\n\nCore ComfyUI nodes only (needs ComfyUI >= 0.26, tested design for 0.34).\n\n**Files**\n- `models/diffusion_models/` -> DaSiWa Krea2 fp8_mixed (civitai model 2760803, version 3362930, file 3251200)\n- `models/text_encoders/` -> qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled\n- `models/vae/` -> qwen_image_vae\n- `models/loras/` -> the two LoRAs\n\n**Turbo settings:** 8 steps, CFG 1, er_sde + simple (or euler + linear_quadratic). ~1536px works well.\n\n**RAW checkpoint instead?** 50+ steps, CFG 3.5, and use the negative prompt.\n\nLoRA strengths start at 0.8; lower them if results look burnt."
      ]
    }
